    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast off into a perilous ascent in this high-octane roguelite platformer. Pilot a rolling starship through procedurally generated levels, navigating treacherous biomes teeming with hazards, dynamic enemies, and formidable bosses. Utilize limited aerial jumps and hover capabilities to dodge obstacles and outpace the relentless rise of molten lava.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/64f4ad976d4ea4172911c6852a4978c4.poster.avif?t=1751926100\" width=558 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/64f4ad976d4ea4172911c6852a4978c4.webm?t=1751926100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/64f4ad976d4ea4172911c6852a4978c4.mp4?t=1751926100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run offers a fresh challenge with randomized upgrades, power-ups, and secret areas to discover. Collect radiant gems to unlock new characters, color palettes, and enhancements, tailoring your journey through multiple distinct worlds. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Gems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/ee5ecd2a152da92dbf5779eccab046b6.poster.avif?t=1751926100\" width=800 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/ee5ecd2a152da92dbf5779eccab046b6.webm?t=1751926100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/ee5ecd2a152da92dbf5779eccab046b6.mp4?t=1751926100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Secret Paths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/7599a7ef880bcb7efb6c499e57a1c272.poster.avif?t=1751926100\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/7599a7ef880bcb7efb6c499e57a1c272.webm?t=1751926100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/7599a7ef880bcb7efb6c499e57a1c272.mp4?t=1751926100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/96ef1909398f3fd8f44b24104f23d9dc.poster.avif?t=1751926100\" width=800 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/96ef1909398f3fd8f44b24104f23d9dc.webm?t=1751926100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/96ef1909398f3fd8f44b24104f23d9dc.mp4?t=1751926100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Squash Bugs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/b45863aee47afd1eecc8f65bafa8e076.poster.avif?t=1751926100\" width=639 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/b45863aee47afd1eecc8f65bafa8e076.webm?t=1751926100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/7a14e1df6b97f6ddf952496a99605688.poster.avif?t=1751926100\" width=617 height=95 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/7a14e1df6b97f6ddf952496a99605688.webm?t=1751926100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of momentum and precision as you strive to escape the abyss. Every leap counts\u2014can you reach the surface before it's too late?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast off into a perilous ascent in this high-octane roguelite platformer. Pilot a rolling starship through procedurally generated levels, navigating treacherous biomes teeming with hazards, dynamic enemies, and formidable bosses. Utilize limited aerial jumps and hover capabilities to dodge obstacles and outpace the relentless rise of molten lava.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/64f4ad976d4ea4172911c6852a4978c4.poster.avif?t=1751926100\" width=558 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/64f4ad976d4ea4172911c6852a4978c4.webm?t=1751926100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/64f4ad976d4ea4172911c6852a4978c4.mp4?t=1751926100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run offers a fresh challenge with randomized upgrades, power-ups, and secret areas to discover. Collect radiant gems to unlock new characters, color palettes, and enhancements, tailoring your journey through multiple distinct worlds. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Gems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/ee5ecd2a152da92dbf5779eccab046b6.poster.avif?t=1751926100\" width=800 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/ee5ecd2a152da92dbf5779eccab046b6.webm?t=1751926100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400370/extras/ee5ecd2a152da92d